alted after us-east: orchestrator error", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 10118, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01XTHH4uZkAW4PhssdTRQ14A", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 11964, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01Vi9Xbd7pKT8mX2y5kCLL5X", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 12264, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01Vi9Xbd7pKT8mX2y5kCLL5X", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 12264, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01Vi9Xbd7pKT8mX2y5kCLL5X", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 15313, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01F7GXPkYDiLgko1nGwxw1pG", "tool": "rollback", "args": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 19313, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01F7GXPkYDiLgko1nGwxw1pG", "tool": "rollback", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 19313, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01F7GXPkYDiLgko1nGwxw1pG", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21319, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01NXAEzhvoH1FGYBqMMVbtiS", "tool": "get_service_status", "args": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 21619, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01NXAEzhvoH1FGYBqMMVbtiS", "tool": "get_service_status", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21619, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01NXAEzhvoH1FGYBqMMVbtiS", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 21619, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_011JUamp5KzvFSpjd3oLFrjn", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 21919, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_011JUamp5KzvFSpjd3oLFrjn", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 21919, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_011JUamp5KzvFSpjd3oLFrjn", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 26603, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01KHMEX8eGVcm6tR4ZjjjC6y", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all production regions after deploy (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. The matching staging candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, leaving regions on different versions. A retry finished the rollout. All regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 57203, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01KHMEX8eGVcm6tR4ZjjjC6y", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 57203, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01KHMEX8eGVcm6tR4ZjjjC6y", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 59393, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_012BuNPpvfCLWwrfxbJ1gnHJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 59693, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_012BuNPpvfCLWwrfxbJ1gnHJ", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 59693, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_012BuNPpvfCLWwrfxbJ1gnHJ", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 64617, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all regions and passing health checks. I opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. The bad release was v2.3.1, and its staging version had also failed health checks. The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after only us-east was updated. I retried once, which was safe because it targets a fixed version, and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created as **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api, open). I didn't send it again, so the on-call engineer was paged only once. The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and next steps: find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator errored during the rollback.\n\nNo approval was needed because v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01R3kzgpsW23om8uQFaC2KBY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_0157qTmEnbW5NVr8sxpXTV6i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"citations": null, "text": "Most recent healthy production release is v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01XTHH4uZkAW4PhssdTRQ14A", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01Vi9Xbd7pKT8mX2y5kCLL5X", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "Only us-east was rolled back before the orchestrator stopped. Running the rollback again is safe because it targets a fixed version, so I'll retry once.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01F7GXPkYDiLgko1nGwxw1pG", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01NXAEzhvoH1FGYBqMMVbtiS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011JUamp5KzvFSpjd3oLFrjn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01KHMEX8eGVcm6tR4ZjjjC6y", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failed health checks in all production regions after deploy (us-east, us-west, eu-west), with an error rate of about 18%. The matching staging candidate, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy. Rolled back to v2.3.0, the most recent release that was healthy in production. The first rollback attempt stopped partway with an orchestrator error after updating only us-east, leaving regions on different versions. A retry finished the rollout. All regions are now on v2.3.0, health checks pass, and the error rate is about 0.2%. Next steps: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure and look into the orchestrator error during rollback.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2"}, "name": "create_incident", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_012BuNPpvfCLWwrfxbJ1gnHJ", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "end_turn", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "checkout-api is back on v2.3.0 in all regions and passing health checks. I opened a SEV2 incident for it.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. The bad release was v2.3.1, and its staging version had also failed health checks. The first rollback attempt stopped with an orchestrator error after only us-east was updated. I retried once, which was safe because it targets a fixed version, and it finished. us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The error rate dropped from about 18% to about 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** The request to create the incident timed out. Before retrying, I checked the incident list and found it had been created as **INC-0001** (SEV2, checkout-api, open). I didn't send it again, so the on-call engineer was paged only once. The incident describes the failure, the rollback (including the partial failure and retry), the current state, and next steps: find out why v2.3.1 failed and why the orchestrator errored during the rollback.\n\nNo approval was needed because v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production.", "type": "text"}]}]}